{"id":"de-witze-1rytv02.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1rytv02","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Every step kept: the find, the station, the advice, the thanks, the next-day meeting. The reported question becomes the man's own line; the man's answer is split so the punch word lands alone.","title":"Der Pinguin","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Mitten in der Stadt findet ein Mann einen Pinguin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er nimmt ihn mit auf ein Polizeirevier.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Was soll ich mit dem Tier machen?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Tja, guter Mann, also ich würde mit dem Pinguin in den Zoo gehen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Mann bedankt sich und zottelt mit dem Pinguin davon.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Am nächsten Tag trifft der Polizist den Mann und den Pinguin zufällig in der Stadt.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Sagen Sie mal, habe ich Ihnen nicht gesagt, dass Sie mit dem Pinguin in den Zoo gehen sollen?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ja, klar, da waren wir gestern.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Heute gehen wir ins Kino.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"off-right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"off-right"}]},{"location":"ofis","transition":"flyover","cast":["sluzhivy","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"police-officer","muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"desk"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"off-right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"off-right"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"flyover","cast":["muzhik","pingvin","sluzhivy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin","sluzhivy":"police-officer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rytv02.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1rytv02","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation; every step kept, the reported question becomes the man's line, the answer split so 'в кино' lands alone.","title":"Пингвин","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Посреди города мужчина находит пингвина.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Он берёт его с собой в полицейский участок.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Что мне делать с этим животным?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Ну что ж, уважаемый, я бы на вашем месте сходил с пингвином в зоопарк.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужчина благодарит и топает с пингвином прочь.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"На следующий день полицейский случайно встречает мужчину с пингвином в городе.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Послушайте, разве я вам не говорил, чтобы вы сходили с пингвином в зоопарк?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Да, конечно, там мы были вчера.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А сегодня идём в кино.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"off-right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"off-right"}]},{"location":"ofis","transition":"flyover","cast":["sluzhivy","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"police-officer","muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"desk"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"off-right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"off-right"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"flyover","cast":["muzhik","pingvin","sluzhivy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin","sluzhivy":"police-officer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rytv02.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1rytv02","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation; every step kept, the reported question becomes the man's line, the answer split so 'the movies' lands alone.","title":"The Penguin","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"In the middle of town, a man finds a penguin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"He takes it with him to a police station.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"What should I do with this animal?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Well, my good man, I would take the penguin to the zoo.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"The man thanks him and trudges off with the penguin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"The next day, the policeman happens to run into the man and the penguin in town.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Say, didn't I tell you to take the penguin to the zoo?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Yes, sure, we went there yesterday.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Today we're going to the movies.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"off-right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"off-right"}]},{"location":"ofis","transition":"flyover","cast":["sluzhivy","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"police-officer","muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"desk"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-right","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"off-right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"off-right"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"flyover","cast":["muzhik","pingvin","sluzhivy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin","sluzhivy":"police-officer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","from":"off-right","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rn43l3.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1rn43l3","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Word for word; the reported first question becomes the teacher's line. The pupil is a schoolboy, so vovochka (unnamed) instead of the suggested young man. Grandpa stays unseen so the car reveal is a surprise.","title":"So wie mein Opa","location":"klass","cast":["uchilka","vovochka"],"roles":{"uchilka":"teacher","vovochka":"vovochka"},"looks":{"uchilka":{"add":["glasses"]}},"lines":[{"character":"uchilka","text":"Wie möchtest du einmal sterben?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"So wie mein Opa.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"Wie ist dein Opa denn gestorben?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Er ist eingeschlafen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"Ja, das ist ein schöner Tod, so würde ich auch sterben wollen.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"Und wie würdest du nicht sterben wollen?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"vovochka","text":"So wie die zwei, die mit Opa mitgefahren sind.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rn43l3.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1rn43l3","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation; the reported first question becomes the teacher's line. Schoolboy played by vovochka, unnamed.","title":"Как дедушка","location":"klass","cast":["uchilka","vovochka"],"roles":{"uchilka":"teacher","vovochka":"vovochka"},"looks":{"uchilka":{"add":["glasses"]}},"lines":[{"character":"uchilka","text":"Как бы ты хотел однажды умереть?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Как мой дедушка.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"А как умер твой дедушка?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Он уснул.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"Да, это прекрасная смерть, я бы тоже хотела так умереть.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"А как бы ты не хотел умереть?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Как те двое, которые ехали с дедушкой.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rn43l3.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1rn43l3","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation; 'riding with Grandpa' keeps the car hidden until the listener gets it. Schoolboy played by vovochka, unnamed.","title":"Like Grandpa","location":"klass","cast":["uchilka","vovochka"],"roles":{"uchilka":"teacher","vovochka":"vovochka"},"looks":{"uchilka":{"add":["glasses"]}},"lines":[{"character":"uchilka","text":"How would you like to die one day?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Like my grandpa.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"And how did your grandpa die?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"He fell asleep.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"Yes, that's a beautiful death, that's how I would want to die too.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"And how would you not want to die?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Like the two people who were riding with Grandpa.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1oh6kll.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1oh6kll","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Word for word; the doctor's entrance is shown by enter. No egg puppet yet: the baby puppet in an egg-white onesie stands in for the egg (requested).","title":"Beim Arzt","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["ptitsa","mladenets","doktor"],"roles":{"ptitsa":"chicken","mladenets":"baby","doktor":"doctor"},"looks":{"mladenets":{"clothes":"#f3ead8"}},"needs":[{"kind":"puppet","id":"yaytso","description":"a large egg with a face, little arms and legs, able to sit on a chair and talk","why":"the egg speaks the punchline and must be visibly an egg next to the chicken"}],"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Huhn und ein Ei sitzen schon früh im Wartezimmer.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"doktor","text":"So, es kann losgehen.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["doktor"]},{"character":"doktor","text":"Wer von Ihnen kommt zuerst?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"mladenets","text":"Boah, ich habe diese Frage so satt!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1oh6kll.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1oh6kll","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"'Кто из вас первый?' carries both the queue and 'что было раньше, курица или яйцо', as the note suggests. No egg puppet yet: the baby puppet in an egg-white onesie stands in (requested).","title":"У врача","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["ptitsa","mladenets","doktor"],"roles":{"ptitsa":"chicken","mladenets":"baby","doktor":"doctor"},"looks":{"mladenets":{"clothes":"#f3ead8"}},"needs":[{"kind":"puppet","id":"yaytso","description":"a large egg with a face, little arms and legs, able to sit on a chair and talk","why":"the egg speaks the punchline and must be visibly an egg next to the chicken"}],"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Курица и яйцо с самого утра сидят в приёмной у врача.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"doktor","text":"Так, можно начинать.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["doktor"]},{"character":"doktor","text":"Кто из вас первый?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"mladenets","text":"Ох, как же меня достал этот вопрос!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1oh6kll.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1oh6kll","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"'Which of you comes first?' works in English for both the queue and the chicken-or-egg question. No egg puppet yet: the baby puppet in an egg-white onesie stands in (requested).","title":"At the Doctor's","location":"bolnitsa","cast":["ptitsa","mladenets","doktor"],"roles":{"ptitsa":"chicken","mladenets":"baby","doktor":"doctor"},"looks":{"mladenets":{"clothes":"#f3ead8"}},"needs":[{"kind":"puppet","id":"yaytso","description":"a large egg with a face, little arms and legs, able to sit on a chair and talk","why":"the egg speaks the punchline and must be visibly an egg next to the chicken"}],"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A chicken and an egg have been sitting in the doctor's waiting room since early morning.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"doktor","text":"Right, let's get started.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["doktor"]},{"character":"doktor","text":"Which of you comes first?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"mladenets","text":"Ugh, I am so sick of that question!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1q9oxt2.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1q9oxt2","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Narration kept because the ravioli cans cannot be drawn; the young man is paren (the suggested muzhik is not young) holding the beer. The man's reply split into two thoughts.","title":"An der Kasse","location":"magazin","cast":["devushka","paren"],"roles":{"devushka":"cashier","paren":"customer"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein junger Mann steht an der Supermarktkasse.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er hat zwei Dosen Ravioli und ein Sixpack Bier auf dem Band liegen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Während die Kassiererin die Ware über den Scanner zieht, sagt sie zu ihm:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"devushka","text":"Ich wette, Sie sind Single!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Ja, richtig!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"paren","text":"Haben Sie das an meinem Einkauf erkannt?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"devushka","text":"Ne, an Ihrem Gesicht!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"magazin","cast":["devushka","paren"],"roles":{"devushka":"cashier","paren":"customer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"bottle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"bottle","action":"give","to":"devushka"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1q9oxt2.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1q9oxt2","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation; narration kept because the ravioli cans cannot be drawn; the young man is paren holding the beer.","title":"На кассе","location":"magazin","cast":["devushka","paren"],"roles":{"devushka":"cashier","paren":"customer"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Молодой человек стоит на кассе в супермаркете.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"На ленте у него две банки равиоли и упаковка из шести бутылок пива.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Пока кассирша пробивает товар, она говорит ему:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"devushka","text":"Спорим, вы холостяк!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Да, точно!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"paren","text":"Вы это по моим покупкам поняли?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"devushka","text":"Не, по вашему лицу!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"magazin","cast":["devushka","paren"],"roles":{"devushka":"cashier","paren":"customer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"bottle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"bottle","action":"give","to":"devushka"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1q9oxt2.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1q9oxt2","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Line-by-line translation; narration kept because the ravioli cans cannot be drawn; the young man is paren holding the beer.","title":"At the Checkout","location":"magazin","cast":["devushka","paren"],"roles":{"devushka":"cashier","paren":"customer"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A young man is standing at the supermarket checkout.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"On the belt he has two cans of ravioli and a six-pack of beer.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"While the cashier scans the items, she says to him:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"devushka","text":"I bet you're single!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Yes, that's right!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"paren","text":"Could you tell from my shopping?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"devushka","text":"Nope, from your face!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"magazin","cast":["devushka","paren"],"roles":{"devushka":"cashier","paren":"customer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"paren","to":"center"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"bottle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"bottle","action":"give","to":"devushka"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1ax5hqq.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1ax5hqq","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"All source narration kept (only typos fixed: 'soll nicht merken', 'stinksauer'); the wife's anger and his question turned into direct speech. Bar, bedroom at night, bedroom next morning. The wheelchair is never shown so the punchline stays a surprise.","title":"Der Rollstuhl","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"drunk","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Mann sitzt gestresst in der Bar und zischt ein Bier nach dem anderen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Als es spät wird und er kaum mehr geradeaus schauen kann, beschließt er, nach Hause zu gehen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er fällt dabei vom Barhocker und schafft es nicht mehr aufzustehen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er beschließt daraufhin, nach Hause zu kriechen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Als er total erschöpft daheim angekrochen kommt, robbt er extra leise durch die Wohnung und die Treppe hoch.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Seine Frau soll nicht merken, dass er schon wieder total dicht nach Hause gekommen ist.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er schafft es ins Bett, ohne dass seine Frau aufwacht, und schläft zufrieden ein.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Am nächsten Morgen ist seine Frau stinksauer.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Du warst schon wieder in der Bar und hast dich zugesoffen!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Wie hast du das schon wieder mitbekommen?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Der Barkeeper hat heute Morgen angerufen.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"zhena","text":"Du hast wieder deinen Rollstuhl in der Bar vergessen.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"drunk","barmen":"bartender"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["red-nose","tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"stool-left"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"glass","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"glass","action":"drop"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"flyover","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"drunk"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["curlers"]},"muzhik":{"add":["red-nose","tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"bed"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"wipe","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"drunk"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["curlers"]},"muzhik":{"add":["red-nose","tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"bed"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1ax5hqq.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1ax5hqq","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"All narration translated step by step; the wife's anger and his question turned into direct speech. The wheelchair is never shown so the punchline stays a surprise.","title":"Коляска","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"drunk","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужчина сидит в баре весь на нервах и глушит одно пиво за другим.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Когда становится поздно и он уже едва может смотреть прямо, он решает пойти домой.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"При этом он падает с барного стула и больше не может подняться.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Тогда он решает ползти домой.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Совершенно обессилев, он доползает до дома и особенно тихо пробирается по квартире и вверх по лестнице.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Жена не должна заметить, что он опять вернулся домой в стельку пьяный.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Он добирается до кровати так, что жена не просыпается, и довольный засыпает.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"На следующее утро жена вне себя от злости.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Ты опять был в баре и напился!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Как ты опять узнала?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Бармен сегодня утром позвонил.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"zhena","text":"Ты опять забыл в баре свою инвалидную коляску.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"drunk","barmen":"bartender"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["red-nose","tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"stool-left"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"glass","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"glass","action":"drop"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"flyover","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"drunk"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["curlers"]},"muzhik":{"add":["red-nose","tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"bed"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"wipe","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"drunk"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["curlers"]},"muzhik":{"add":["red-nose","tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"bed"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1ax5hqq.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1ax5hqq","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"All narration translated step by step; the wife's anger and his question turned into direct speech. The wheelchair is never shown so the punchline stays a surprise.","title":"The Wheelchair","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"drunk","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A stressed man sits in a bar, knocking back one beer after another.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"When it gets late and he can hardly see straight anymore, he decides to go home.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"On the way he falls off the bar stool and can't get back up.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"So he decides to crawl home.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Completely exhausted, he crawls home and creeps extra quietly through the house and up the stairs.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"His wife mustn't notice that he's come home completely plastered again.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"He makes it into bed without waking his wife and falls asleep, satisfied.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"The next morning his wife is furious.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"You were at the bar again and got hammered!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"How did you find out this time?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"The bartender called this morning.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"zhena","text":"You left your wheelchair at the bar again.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"drunk","barmen":"bartender"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["red-nose","tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"stool-left"},{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"glass","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"glass","action":"drop"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"flyover","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"drunk"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["curlers"]},"muzhik":{"add":["red-nose","tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"bed"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]},{"location":"spalnya","transition":"wipe","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"drunk"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["curlers"]},"muzhik":{"add":["red-nose","tie"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"bed"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1jwzu7a.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1jwzu7a","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Reported speech turned into direct lines with the source wording (typo Erwim fixed to Erwin); the farmer's honest answer split into two thoughts. He walks into the station on the narrator line.","title":"Trauerfall auf dem Bauernhof","location":"ofis","cast":["sluzhivy","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"police-officer","muzhik-ryzhy":"farmer"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Bauer Erwin erscheint mit Tränen in den Augen auf der örtlichen Polizeiwache.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik-ryzhy"]},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Ich habe meinen Esel heute Morgen tot im Stall aufgefunden.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Gibt es denn Anzeichen für ein Verbrechen?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Nein, der Esel war schon alt und krank.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Nach einigem Leiden hat er es nun endlich geschafft.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Und warum haben Sie dann jetzt die Polizei aufgesucht?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Na, ich wollte nur die nächsten Angehörigen informieren.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1jwzu7a.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1jwzu7a","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Reported speech turned into direct lines, translated closely; the farmer keeps his name Erwin from the source. He walks into the station on the narrator line.","title":"Горе на ферме","location":"ofis","cast":["sluzhivy","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"police-officer","muzhik-ryzhy":"farmer"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Фермер Эрвин со слезами на глазах приходит в местный полицейский участок.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik-ryzhy"]},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Сегодня утром я нашёл своего осла мёртвым в хлеву.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"А есть признаки преступления?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Нет, осёл был уже старый и больной.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"После долгих мучений он наконец-то отмучился.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Тогда зачем же вы пришли в полицию?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Ну, я просто хотел сообщить ближайшим родственникам.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1jwzu7a.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1jwzu7a","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Reported speech turned into direct lines, translated closely; 'inform the next of kin' keeps the insult. The farmer keeps his name Erwin from the source.","title":"A Death on the Farm","location":"ofis","cast":["sluzhivy","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"police-officer","muzhik-ryzhy":"farmer"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Farmer Erwin shows up at the local police station with tears in his eyes.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik-ryzhy"]},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"This morning I found my donkey dead in the barn.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Are there any signs of a crime?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"No, the donkey was already old and sick.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"After a good deal of suffering, he finally made it.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Then why have you come to the police?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Well, I just wanted to inform the next of kin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1r0tsei.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1r0tsei","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Title line dropped (not spoken). The told steps are staged as three scenes: the child asks the father in the living room, goes to the mother in the kitchen and repeats the same question, then runs back to the father.","title":"Adam und Eva oder Darwin","location":"gostinaya","cast":["vovochka-drug","muzhik"],"roles":{"vovochka-drug":"child","muzhik":"father"},"lines":[{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Wie sind Menschen entstanden?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Adam und Eva bekamen Kinder,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"dann wurden ihre Kinder erwachsen und bekamen selbst Kinder und so weiter.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Wie sind Menschen entstanden?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Wir waren früher Affen, dann haben wir uns zu dem entwickelt, was wir heute sind.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Du hast mich angelogen!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Nein, deine Mutter hat nur von ihrer Seite der Familie gesprochen.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["vovochka-drug","muzhik"],"roles":{"vovochka-drug":"child","muzhik":"father"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"newspaper","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","to":"off-left"}]},{"location":"kukhnya","transition":"wipe","cast":["zhena","vovochka-drug"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka-drug":"child"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"table"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","to":"off-left"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","transition":"wipe","cast":["vovochka-drug","muzhik"],"roles":{"vovochka-drug":"child","muzhik":"father"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"newspaper","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1r0tsei.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1r0tsei","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Title line dropped. Line-by-line translation; the told steps are staged as three scenes: father in the living room, mother in the kitchen, back to the father. 'Seite der Familie' → 'своя родня', the natural Russian.","title":"Адам и Ева или Дарвин","location":"gostinaya","cast":["vovochka-drug","muzhik"],"roles":{"vovochka-drug":"child","muzhik":"father"},"lines":[{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Как появились люди?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"У Адама и Евы родились дети,","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"потом их дети выросли и сами родили детей, и так далее.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Как появились люди?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Раньше мы были обезьянами, а потом развились в тех, кто мы есть сейчас.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Ты меня обманул!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Нет, твоя мама просто говорила о своей родне.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"gostinaya","cast":["vovochka-drug","muzhik"],"roles":{"vovochka-drug":"child","muzhik":"father"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"newspaper","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","to":"off-left"}]},{"location":"kukhnya","transition":"wipe","cast":["zhena","vovochka-drug"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka-drug":"child"},"looks":{"zhena":{"add":["glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"zhena","to":"table"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","to":"off-left"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","transition":"wipe","cast":["vovochka-drug","muzhik"],"roles":{"vovochka-drug":"child","muzhik":"father"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik","item":"newspaper","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka-drug","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
